          "heading": "Jeremy Ward, South African-born, named in France's 42-player Nations Championship squad",
          "body": "France have confirmed South African-born centre Jeremy Ward in their 42-player squad for the Nations Championship, the call-up flagged by SA Rugby Magazine. Named by Fabien Galthié on Wednesday, Ward is a Stade Français teammate of Tani Vili, and the squad is built to fill gaps left by injury. The catch: he will not be eligible to play for France until next year, just before the World Cup in Australia, so this is a squad place for now."
