          "heading": "Ebbw Vale's Curtis Gregory sent off for stamp; WRU awaits referee's report",
          "body": "Ebbw Vale's Curtis Gregory was shown a straight red card for stamping on an opponent in Thursday night's Super Rygbi Cymru club match against Llandovery, a game shown live on S4C. Referee Craig Evans issued a permanent red in the 35th minute, and footage of the incident has been picked up by news outlets in South Africa and Australia. The Welsh Rugby Union is awaiting the official's report before a disciplinary panel considers sanctions, and calls for a lifetime ban are growing."
