          "heading": "Contepomi brings back captain Montoya and Kremer for 33-man training camp",
          "body": "Felipe Contepomi has recalled captain Julián Montoya and enforcer Marcos Kremer for a 33-man squad that assembles from Monday for a three-day camp, his strongest roster of the year according to Americas Rugby News. Montoya and Kremer both missed the recent home tests against Australia and South Africa. Ignacio Ruiz and Joaquín Oviedo are injured, and Benjamín Grondona and Matías Moroni are not included. Contepomi confirms his November squad after the camp, and the end-of-year tour takes in Ireland, Italy and France."
