          "heading": "Miles Amatosero earns Wallabies recall despite red card and suspension history",
          "body": "Waratahs brawler Miles Amatosero earns a recall to the Wallabies squad despite a shaky disciplinary record, back from injury for the Northern Hemisphere tour. He was banned at the start of the season for punching clubmate Angus Scott-Young in training, and his second cap, off the bench against Japan, ended in a red card and a three-match suspension after a clash with captain Warner Dearns. Kiss has picked him anyway, naming him in the 33-man group for the tour."
