          "heading": "Warner Deans returns from injury as Japan face Fiji without Michael Leitch",
          "body": "Warner Deans is back from injury for Japan's JRFU 100th Anniversary Match against Fiji today, after training camps brought his return alongside props Yota Kamimori and Keijiro Tamesawa and backs Shinya Komura and Yoshihei Ishida. Michael Leitch is still absent, stuck on 97 caps. Charlie Lawrence and Koga Nezuka are called up for the first time this year. Fiji, under new coach Jake White, name four uncapped players among their starters and reserves. Japan won the Pacific Nations Cup final against them in September, their first title since 2019."
