          "kicker": "Officiating row",
          "heading": "Steve Hansen labels World Rugby a 'secret society' before November referee summit",
          "body": "Former All Blacks coach Sir Steve Hansen has accused World Rugby of being a 'secret society', claiming it has not told anyone about a directive to referees on the TMO. On the Rugby Unity podcast he said the yellow card needs urgent work, pointing to too many matches where sides play a man down, 13 on 15 or 14 on 15, for unintentional offences. With a World Rugby summit of coaches and referees due in November, when New Zealand's Scotland Test falls, Hansen wants the conversation to be open."
